# Paths ESLint must never walk. Mirrors R:\GPTHub\frontend\.eslintignore:1-12.
#
# WHY these four and no more: the lint contract is "every file a developer edits",
# which is src/ only. Everything else is either generated (build/), vendored
# (node_modules/), or plain Node tooling outside the browser bundle (scripts/ is
# an .mjs dependency checker, not application code, and it is not part of the
# CRA eslint-config chain).
build/
node_modules/
scripts/
coverage/
